00:20:20.690 --> 00:20:23.930
But it's going to be really hard to follow this path

00:20:23.930 --> 00:20:26.290
when we can't see very far in front of us.

00:20:29.240 --> 00:20:29.980
Use our ears and...

00:20:30.540 --> 00:20:31.700
to help get through the fog.

00:20:35.130 --> 00:20:37.410
I'm having a little trouble seeing with my ears.

00:20:37.990 --> 00:20:38.590
Just saying.

00:20:39.100 --> 00:20:41.660
Well, no, since it's hard to see,

00:20:42.000 --> 00:20:43.840
let's use our ears to listen for

00:20:43.840 --> 00:20:46.780
and nose to smell for clues to the ocean.

00:20:47.220 --> 00:20:47.960
Shall we?

00:20:48.640 --> 00:20:53.360
Listening, listening, listening.

00:20:54.700 --> 00:20:56.240
Do you hear that?

00:20:58.290 --> 00:20:59.570
Oops, my bad.

00:21:00.000 --> 00:21:00.800
My tummy's hungry.

00:21:01.060 --> 00:21:02.140
So embarrassing.

00:21:02.770 --> 00:21:04.630
Oh, Hal, listen again.

00:21:06.290 --> 00:21:06.770
Waves.

00:21:07.010 --> 00:21:10.310
And where there are waves, oh, brother, there's an ocean.

00:21:10.700 --> 00:21:11.510
Come on, guys.

00:21:11.850 --> 00:21:23.780
Now the sea waves this way.

00:21:26.120 --> 00:21:27.640
The sky is getting lighter.

00:21:30.670 --> 00:21:33.110
Granny Bunny will get her wish, and we'll get to see...

00:21:33.110 --> 00:21:34.950
Whoa! Whoa, whoa, whoa!

00:22:00.410 --> 00:22:02.450
Missing you on my watch, Sunrise!

00:22:08.460 --> 00:22:29.980
It's awfully an amazing...

00:22:31.080 --> 00:22:38.080
What he said and she said and she said.

00:22:38.540 --> 00:22:42.550
Mr. Cat, you've made Bunny very, very happy.

00:22:42.930 --> 00:22:47.710
My rift and I got to experience it through your eyes as well as mine.

00:22:48.080 --> 00:22:51.580
Twas nothing, Granny Bunny. Anything for you.

00:22:51.920 --> 00:22:53.660
Hey, the fog's not so thick anymore.

00:22:53.880 --> 00:22:55.340
Ooh, I can see a lot more.

00:22:55.620 --> 00:22:58.040
Bye, fog. I love you. Miss you.

00:22:58.260 --> 00:22:59.340
Keep in touch, okay?

00:23:00.890 --> 00:23:03.860
This is so beautiful and bright.

00:23:04.120 --> 00:23:04.860
Shades time.

00:23:06.860 --> 00:23:08.420
It's so inspiring.

00:23:09.190 --> 00:23:11.050
It sure is, Nature Cat.

00:23:11.270 --> 00:23:12.790
It sure is.

00:23:16.980 --> 00:23:19.400
Nature Cat, Squeaks, Daisy, and Hal

00:23:19.400 --> 00:23:22.240
are cartoon characters and not real animals.

00:23:22.380 --> 00:23:24.750
To keep all of our animal friends safe,

00:23:25.000 --> 00:23:27.000
check with a grown up before you bring a pet

00:23:27.000 --> 00:23:28.640
on your next nature adventure.

00:23:30.540 --> 00:23:30.720
HA HA!
